Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1019-1021] Onigashima 32 - Triceracopter.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:30.09,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1638,298)}Castle Interior\NPerformance Floor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.79,0:01:32.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:38.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:49.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a super-sparkly lizard,\NI get it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sparkle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.61,0:02:02.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tech that lets you fire lasers\Nas much as you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:04.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds like something\NFranky would want!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:05.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:06.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:09.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're really sure about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:19.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get a load of my Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.97,0:02:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Swirly Brow ain't gonna\Nbreak through here on his own!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's ol' Zoro for ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:35.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Very well!\NPrepare the injection, Miyagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:48.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:50.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too deep, too deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:51.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:03:00.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're so heavily bandaged,\NI don't know where your veins are...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.05,0:03:01.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take them off first!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're indeed right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh well,\Nlet's get on with it anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you kno—\NYo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:30.71,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1695,305)}Onigashima Skull Dome\NRight-Brain Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:36.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.79,0:03:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give Sasaki hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:40.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:42.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:46.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys came back here\Nto back me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:47.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.31,0:03:47.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:52.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Armored Division?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.89,0:03:57.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you're all having your strings pulled\N'cause of some enemy ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:04:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it's still an act of treason,\Nand that's a fact!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:19.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:27.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, you're one tough\Npain in the neck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.93,0:04:30.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was pretty sure I landed some\Nkiller hits back there...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:34.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the one being\Nthe hard thorn in my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.65,0:04:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...get the hell outta my way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heard all our underlings on the\NPerformance Floor switched sides, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:04.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm headin' there to send everyone\Nthat turned against us to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:17.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Protect Wano, in my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:22.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your might is a valuable asset\Nto me, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:28.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that how a parent ought\Nspeak to their child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.45,0:05:34.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I fought tooth and claw\Nfor that Devil Fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I wasn't about to\Nlet you eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:41.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...was hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:44.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was shocked, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:48.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want to set out to sea,\Nand now I cannot swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:52.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many times has it been that\NI've made attempts on your life...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:54.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...only to be struck down\Njust as many times!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:56.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it made me stronger,\Nif nothing else!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.23,0:06:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was not just those shackles...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that chained me to this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:05.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I do not fight for\Nthe sake of my country...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:10.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dare not call myself Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.99,0:06:15.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get this party started!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.83,0:06:21.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm...\NSo that's what they call a Man-Beast Form!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:25.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid-ass robot!\NYou're just asking to be kicked outta the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:30.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trick Mechanism:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.97,0:06:33.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:44.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bringin' out that\Nnasty sword again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't gettin' outta\Nthe way for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:49.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:50.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:52.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.99,0:06:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it, Sasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:06:59.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:01.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:04.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go help out everyone else,\Nthe buncha yas!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bet you're glad\Nthose bums're gone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:19.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like I'm not gonna get\Nany help around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.77,0:07:26.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha?!\NThat thing rotates?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:30.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do dinos...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:33.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...work that way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.99,0:07:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-It's that technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:41.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That ain't good!\NGet out of here, Iron Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:46.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dumbasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.25,0:07:49.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Try worrying about yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:52.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heliceratops!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:04.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guyyyys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.78,0:08:12.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell\Nkinda move is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.99,0:08:15.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he trying to\Ntake this to the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:22.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,General Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,General Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:48.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, is that\Nfreakin' cool or what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Triceratops...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.44,0:08:51.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Triceratops...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.07,0:08:53.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...are just that kinda dino!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.99,0:08:56.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna charge...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.45,0:09:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...at that speed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo, dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:08.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see whatcha got!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:12.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,General Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.85,0:09:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:28.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:31.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:36.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kiddin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:42.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Propellers change the direction of thrust\Ndepending on which way they turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he made it rotate the wrong way...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:52.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which explains why\Nhe went backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.21,0:09:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Space to run...\NSecured!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:58.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're full of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.51,0:09:59.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaddap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:03.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The longer the approach,\Nthe stronger my charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:08.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Countin' on ya,\NGeneral Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:10.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bulletriceratops!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:22.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap!\NMy shoulder launcher's gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:31.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say goodnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:33.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:35.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:37.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,General...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:40.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Suplex!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:57.65,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1640,293)}Polar Tang\NThe seas near Wano
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:56.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back to us,\NStraw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.78,0:10:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If only the Captain were here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:03.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got all the water\Nout of his lungs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:05.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What else can we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:07.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think giving him pills\Nmight work!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.95,0:11:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, we gotta give him a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.54,0:11:12.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His face is turning blue...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:13.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.59,0:11:17.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:28.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:31.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:41.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're tough all around,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:43.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're tough all around,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:46.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you've got a gash\Non your stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:48.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This'll put you\Ndown for the count!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:50.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franken-Sword:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:57.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,V-for-Victory Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice try, dumbass robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.77,0:12:19.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap!\NI ain't good with swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:44.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that's how we're doin' this,\Nthen I'll just pull out the biggest tide-turner I got...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:54.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Running away?\NShame!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:56.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aww, crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:13:00.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ended up by\Nthe Performance Floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:05.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't let this jerk get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.95,0:13:12.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bulletriceratops!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All set!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Portable Gaon Cannon:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:29.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,General Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.03,0:13:50.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do you think\Nyou're messin' with?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:53.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're terror itself,\Nthe Flying Six of the Animal Kingdom Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I'm goin' down,\NI'm takin' you with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:59.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Magnumceratops!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Magnumceratops!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:03.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All set!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:08.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky Radical Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.61,0:14:31.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Dog-Dog Fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:34.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mythical Type!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:40.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Model: Okuchi-no-Makami.\NOne of the rare Mythical Type fruits!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And a guardian deity of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eaten by someone calling themselves\N"Oden", of all people!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A huge failure on my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:55.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's why I'm telling you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.51,0:14:58.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Protect Wano for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.93,0:15:00.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You twist the meaning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:15.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi had a talent for exploitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.91,0:15:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This country is a weapon factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dominate it by forcing\Nits people to labor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:27.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am...\NKozuki Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.22,0:15:39.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I shall open Wano's borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:46.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,free its people!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.44,0:15:50.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:53.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and this country...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...shall be set loose\Nunto the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:05.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Namuji Glacier Fang!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:22.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't be opening\Nany borders!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:38.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:45.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doesn't appear to be\Nyour ordinary fog, hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.09,0:16:51.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've grown up, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:07.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've become\Na fine archaeologist, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:16.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:19.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mom's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:22.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.29,0:17:30.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mustn't, Robin-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:33.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Illusion Mist...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.05,0:17:37.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fondest memories\Nwill lead you to ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:43.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see, I know...\Nthat this is all an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:56.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a pity, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This illusion is a mirror...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:02.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A mirror that reflects\Nmy childish heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.37,0:18:04.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.70,0:18:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...while my friends are fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:11.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't just lose myself\Nin my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.59,0:18:15.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget about your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:32.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saul wouldn't say such things!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,History is one of\Nmankind's treasures!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it will, without a doubt,\Nilluminate the future we'll live in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:47.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something I'm certain you people\Nwouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:55.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tres Mano:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:56.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Freesia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.85,0:19:05.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why didn't the Illusion Mist...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.89,0:19:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why didn't it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She ran off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.11,0:19:23.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go! Catch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:31.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was worried\Nabout you, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Robin-san, you should have told me\Nher mist had no effect on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.50,0:19:37.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you\Nlooking out for me, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.21,0:19:40.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For goodness' sake,\Npreying upon others' memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:42.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Such foul play!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.13,0:19:47.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Black Maria-sama's Illusion Mist\Ndidn't work on either of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.97,0:19:49.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:51.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.90,0:19:58.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She assaulted\Nher own mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:01.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Truly a wicked woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:04.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come no closerrr...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.95,0:20:06.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:08.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...terrifies me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:09.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Noooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:09.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Noooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:11.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:13.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You seem unaffected as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.62,0:20:13.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:17.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That "Illusion Mist" of hers\Nis quite cruel, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amid those mists for fifty years...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:30.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How I wished the deaths of my crewmates\Nwere but a dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:57.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybowhoooa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.55,0:21:06.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every day,\NI would see their images dance before me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:08.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and it would wound me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.68,0:21:13.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have so much\Nin common, don't we!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every ordeal we endured\Nwas for this very moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.98,0:21:22.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanyudo Sleeve Swing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:27.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Again with that odd weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.41,0:21:30.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pug Smile Fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:37.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't be\Nrunning out on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.26,0:21:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Illusions don't affect you,\Nyou say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet, you are still\Ncaught in a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.01,0:21:53.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A dream where you can\Ndefeat Kaido-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.98,0:22:00.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spider Net!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.99,0:22:06.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.32,0:22:11.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The floor's a sea of flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.16,0:22:15.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't stop now,\Nthe fire will spread throughout the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.41,0:22:17.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're concerned about us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.91,0:22:19.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.17,0:22:23.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why not surrender to us, then...\NNico Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.13,0:22:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-san, mind keeping\Nhold of me for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.43,0:22:31.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that is a living weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:34.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soul:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.81,0:22:36.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cold Soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.73,0:22:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's coooold!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.98,0:22:43.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanyudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.78,0:22:55.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Being hot, or far too hot,\Nis prohibited!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:22:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:04.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soul Parade:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.14,0:23:19.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburn!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.98,0:23:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't know\Nwhen to give in, do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.31,0:23:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.78,0:23:28.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see it, do you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.49,0:23:33.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how you look at it,\Nyour friend has betrayed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.62,0:23:38.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Leg called for you, before my very eyes...\NKnowing full well that I was seeking you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:40.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:44.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fact you are highly sought after\Nby the world's great movers...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.71,0:23:47.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...makes you a liability\Nto your crewmates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.92,0:23:51.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is why he called for you\Nwithout a second thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.34,0:23:57.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me, Robin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:06.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black-Leg is the laughingstock\Nof all Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.23,0:24:10.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He holds the second highest bounty\Namong your crew, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.82,0:24:13.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a display of\Nyour crew's true strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.74,0:24:18.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that Sanji-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I nearly split a seam laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.91,0:24:24.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-san!\NMay I leave her to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.46,0:24:27.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what I had in mind.\NThank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.05,0:24:33.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I shall tend to\Nthe other beasts that roam the night!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.30,0:24:37.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though I'm afraid of ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.18,0:24:39.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you feel hurt by him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.85,0:24:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.52,0:24:43.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.23,0:24:49.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And there's no need\Nfor you to understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.03,0:24:52.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...why he asked for my help!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.90,0:24:56.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He is a man worthy of being\Nthe wings...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.49,0:24:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...of the Pirate King.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.50,0:25:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gigante Fleurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.28,0:25:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Angry, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.11,0:25:39.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had no idea\Nyou could grow so large!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.45,0:25:42.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must take a toll on you, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.08,0:25:43.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.04,0:25:46.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This was over before it even began!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.46,0:25:51.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sea Serpent Snapdragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.30,0:26:00.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.60,0:26:01.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't even try!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.89,0:26:06.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.98,0:26:13.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not expect to entrap me\Nwithout a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.45,0:26:20.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So your true body\Ntakes the punishment, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.32,0:26:24.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good thing, then,\Nthat my target is so massive!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.04,0:26:26.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite the number of arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.41,0:26:28.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also just as large!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.67,0:26:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.55,0:26:35.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The poison barbs\Non the ends of my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.42,0:26:35.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marianette!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.13,0:26:38.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marianette!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.94,0:26:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meat! I want more meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.61,0:26:59.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(306,300)}Tokage Port\NLand of Wano
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.90,0:27:01.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, haul up more!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.16,0:27:04.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's already eaten\Nall the provisions aboard the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.41,0:27:07.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think\Nwe can find meat around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.54,0:27:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.96,0:27:11.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.09,0:27:16.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.13,0:27:20.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You found him in the middle of the ocean!\NA complete miracle, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.59,0:27:24.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, we heard a voice\Nwhile under the surface...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.01,0:27:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! What great fortune!\NYou really are alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.73,0:27:31.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You fell off too?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.19,0:27:34.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye, we fled from Kaido\Nby way of Shinobu's kite.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.19,0:27:40.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, Luffy...!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.07,0:27:49.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To allow our egress, Kiku and Kin'emon gave their lives...\NBefore our very eyes...!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.04,0:27:56.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Save it for later!\NYer always like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.04,0:27:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the General!\NThis ain't over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.88,0:28:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop whining!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.93,0:28:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't nothin' over 'til\NKaido's ass is kicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.47,0:28:10.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffytaro!\NYou mustn't be so harsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.81,0:28:14.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told ya to\Nstop sobbing, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.23,0:28:16.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the future Shogun,\Nain't ya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.91,0:28:28.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.91,0:28:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want more! Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.46,0:28:36.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We get it already!\NWe're gonna go hunt some down!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.67,0:28:38.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.72,0:28:47.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're getting weaker,\Naren't ya, Straw Hat...?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.22,0:28:52.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you die now,\NI'm gonna be in deep crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.23,0:28:57.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't beat him,\Nthere's no way I'm getting out of the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.61,0:29:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.32,0:29:06.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.12,0:29:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take me back up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn into a dragon\Nand fly me there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.75,0:29:16.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.46,0:29:19.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awhuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.17,0:29:21.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm takin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.67,0:29:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Kaido down!
